WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.800
A cold list blasted cold gets bounced.

00:04.800 --> 00:09.800
No research, no send window, no follow-up. Two hundred a day from one inbox, and the domain takes the hit.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.500
Research first. Then a send window.

00:15.500 --> 00:21.800
Every CSV row is scraped, enriched by any OpenAI-compatible model, and scheduled for 09:30 in the prospect's own timezone.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
15 a day. Three follow-ups. A reply ends it.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.500
One shared daily cap protects the inbox. Follow-ups ride the same thread, three business days apart, and stop the moment someone answers.
